          "headline": "RBI MPC meeting begins, 'hawkish pause' on repo rate expected amidst inflation concerns",
          "summary": "The RBI's Monetary Policy Committee began its three-day meeting on August 3, 2026, and is widely anticipated to keep the benchmark repo rate unchanged at 5.25%. This expected 'hawkish pause' is attributed to persistent inflation risks from geopolitical tensions, elevated crude oil prices, and an uneven monsoon. June retail inflation accelerated to 4.38%, and wholesale inflation climbed to 9.87%.",
